    "reviews": "\u201cFun and addictive arcade-style bullet-hell arena-survival game with interesting mechanics.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 Steam Curator: IndieGems<br><br>\u201cVery well done arcade-style shoot em' up game with good animations, diversified weapons and a good soundtrack.\u201d<br>\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 \u2013 Steam Curator: Excellent Reviews<br><br>\u201cextremely addictive gameplay, though quite challenging...\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 Steam Curator: LifeIsReallyStrange<br>",
